    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "manager",
        "speaker": "Manager",
        "sourceStart": 9,
        "sourceEnd": 130,
        "text": "We need to review the smaller-plate trial before deciding whether to continue it. What did your student group find, Rani?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "d8306f95c43572ef6d9133d12a051aa480c86c27fdc4bb4b95a3f4dcef03f02c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "rani",
        "speaker": "Rani",
        "sourceStart": 137,
        "sourceEnd": 410,
        "text": "We weighed food left on returned plates for five lunch services. Plate waste fell from an average of thirty kilograms a day in the previous week to twenty-two during the trial. However, fewer meals were served during the trial because a department was away on a field trip.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "aa3b07e68820d97247cc11833f4da07b9bbd52c326612fd1ca63cf40a7438e4b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "manager",
        "speaker": "Manager",
        "sourceStart": 420,
        "sourceEnd": 464,
        "text": "So the daily total is not a fair comparison?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "9f7e90eb2d01c22317e187a27ac0ac37e894cf005b2bf99b05f6d6f03e311167",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "rani",
        "speaker": "Rani",
        "sourceStart": 471,
        "sourceEnd": 668,
        "text": "Not on its own. We need the waste per meal as well. We have meal counts from the till, so we can calculate that. We did not weigh food left in the kitchen. Our figures concern returned plates only.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "0e056318596e088efc79371c913107b373822837d41d60b4f29fc8acb132a777",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "manager",
        "speaker": "Manager",
        "sourceStart": 678,
        "sourceEnd": 716,
        "text": "Did customers like the smaller plates?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "c57f415001c28581bd2d237f43889a52b997ae58aa0ad8fe9b0bc07098116054",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "rani",
        "speaker": "Rani",
        "sourceStart": 723,
        "sourceEnd": 1012,
        "text": "The comment cards were mixed. Some liked being able to take a small portion first and come back for more. Others thought the change was a way to raise prices, although prices stayed the same. The sign explaining free second helpings was behind the water machine, where it was easy to miss.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "429054342e4cff16c8b8a12c82e594066282369d1907a85aae577f5a767ad67e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "manager",
        "speaker": "Manager",
        "sourceStart": 1022,
        "sourceEnd": 1080,
        "text": "We can move that sign. Did second helpings create a queue?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "a577a911dfbca4fc5bdfceaaf327583050c86eaed52adbc08f8bd88fe75aea8f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "rani",
        "speaker": "Rani",
        "sourceStart": 1087,
        "sourceEnd": 1313,
        "text": "We observed the serving area on two days. The longest queue was at twelve fifteen, but there was only one server then because another staff member was unloading deliveries. We cannot attribute the queue entirely to plate size.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "b8bbe2dba26e60b055ff45da527cc766a45b7c02cfd6f5fdcebb81dc3a47f896",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "manager",
        "speaker": "Manager",
        "sourceStart": 1323,
        "sourceEnd": 1353,
        "text": "What would you recommend next?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "e6cda7d398eedc33a7814ea1ad49dcbb8d524d0f4fda06d5ef8deed54a5efcc5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "rani",
        "speaker": "Rani",
        "sourceStart": 1360,
        "sourceEnd": 1648,
        "text": "Keep recording for two more weeks with normal attendance, display the second-helping information clearly and note staffing levels. Also ask customers a specific question about whether the portions meet their needs. A general satisfaction question might not tell us why someone is unhappy.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "9333ce95986f3064de5863f858a827111397345eeb7387bbdd6de5d2ac1a04d3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "manager",
        "speaker": "Manager",
        "sourceStart": 1658,
        "sourceEnd": 1691,
        "text": "And what about the price rumours?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "eebe7fe939ca97e6cce66a169c09c05ee872d0651097cbcfd2afa9ad8be24163",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "rani",
        "speaker": "Rani",
        "sourceStart": 1698,
        "sourceEnd": 1877,
        "text": "Put the unchanged prices where customers collect plates. Clear information may solve a misunderstanding, but we should still check whether people find repeated trips inconvenient.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "36c27fd25fa304778826b18afaedff9d4e99d7b6a56f1fce11b99917e1c79e59",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      }
    ]
  },
